From 40a02e77dfa936735647cfb79f976814ad78ffd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:59:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(header): link the logo to the Semper Admin Portal

The header logo now links to https://semper-admin-portal.app.cloud.gov/,
opening in a new tab so a reader keeps their place in Nexus.

Built as a real anchor rather than a click handler on the image, so it is
reachable by keyboard, announced by screen readers, and works with middle-click
and open-in-new-window. The anchor carries no link decoration, so the header
looks unchanged, and it gains a brass focus ring instead of the invisible focus
an image-with-handler would have.

- rel="noopener noreferrer" on the cross-origin target.
- Image alt changes from "Nexus Logo" to "Semper Admin Portal", since alt text
  on a linked image should describe the destination rather than the picture.
- A visually hidden label states the destination and that it opens in a new
  tab, since the logo carries no visible text.
- Hover and focus give a subtle scale and opacity shift, suppressed under
  prefers-reduced-motion.
- No CSP change needed. This is a navigation, not a fetch.
- Bump style.css cache buster to v=34.

Verified in headless Chromium: the anchor resolves to the portal URL with
target _blank and rel noopener noreferrer, the logo image renders inside it at
48x45, text-decoration computes to none, the hidden label reads correctly, and
two Tab presses land focus on the link with a visible outline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NEbgLvn6i9pcjQQiZWpDeB
---
 index.html |  7 +++++--
 style.css  | 31 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 36 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index 5aac23c..927ad55 100644
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -39,7 +39,7 @@
 <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
 <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon.svg">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="semper-tokens.css?v=3">
-<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=33">
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=34">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="ai-improvements.css?v=2">
 <script src="vendor/purify.min.js?v=3.4.13"></script>
 <script src="lib/safe-html.js?v=4"></script>
@@ -52,7 +52,10 @@
 
 <header>
   <div class="branding">
-    <img src="logo.png" alt="Nexus Logo" class="header-logo">
+    <a href="https://semper-admin-portal.app.cloud.gov/" class="header-logo-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Semper Admin Portal (opens in a new tab)">
+      <img src="logo.png" alt="Semper Admin Portal" class="header-logo">
+      <span class="sr-only">Go to the Semper Admin Portal (opens in a new tab)</span>
+    </a>
     <div class="header-text">
       <h1 class="gradient-accent">Nexus</h1>
       <p class="byline">by Semper Admin</p>
diff --git a/style.css b/style.css
index 4e324cc..4a49b18 100644
--- a/style.css
+++ b/style.css
@@ -107,6 +107,37 @@ header.header--hidden {
   transition: height 0.2s ease;
 }
 
+/* The header logo links to the Semper Admin Portal. No link decoration, so
+   the header looks unchanged, but it stays a real focus target for keyboard
+   users rather than an image that happens to be clickable. */
+.header-logo-link {
+  display: inline-flex;
+  align-items: center;
+  text-decoration: none;
+  border-radius: 4px;
+  transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
+}
+
+.header-logo-link:hover .header-logo,
+.header-logo-link:focus-visible .header-logo {
+  opacity: 0.85;
+  transform: scale(1.04);
+}
+
+.header-logo-link:focus-visible {
+  outline: 2px solid var(--color-brass, #C8A951);
+  outline-offset: 3px;
+}
+
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
+  .header-logo-link,
+  .header-logo-link:hover .header-logo,
+  .header-logo-link:focus-visible .header-logo {
+    transition: none;
+    transform: none;
+  }
+}
+
 .header-text {
   display: flex;
   flex-direction: column;
-- 
